          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "SQL injection in username/password — Ruled out: POST /login\n\nProbe matrix executed against POST /login via authenticated CSRF-token harvest: `admin'--`, `' OR 1=1--`, `admin' OR '1'='1`, `admin'#`, `admin' AND 1=1#` vs `admin' AND 1=2#` (balanced pair), `admin' AND SLEEP(15)#`, `'||'`, and password-field injection. Every payload returned HTTP 200 with an identical 9578-byte login-failure body, zero SQL error markers, no boolean differential, and no timing delta from SLEEP(15). Control: benign admin/admin also 200/9578. Login authenticates via Laravel Eloquent binding (parameterised), so injection payloads are treated as literal strings. Raw results in /workspace/sqlin/results.jsonl."
          },
